  "releaseNotes": "## Version 6.3.0 - January 7, 2025\n\n  - **Fixed:* Re-added net472 version of Microsoft.Azure.Storage.Blob.Internal.dll to fix Azure Blob upload stalling problems.\n    Back in v5.8.5 (April 7, 2023), we fixed DocumentCache stalling when creating empty files on AzureBlobFileSystem on .NET Framework projects.\n    However it seems, the stalling problem could also occur for bigger files (probably for files bigger than a 4MB chunk).\n    This problem which only effected using DocumentCache on Azure Blob and in .NET Framework projects, is now fixed.\n\n  - **Improved:** Updated libraries.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "title": "Common Library for GleamTech Products",
